## ✨ 1. Elegant Pipeline with Functional Composition

```js
const pipe = (...fns) => x => fns.reduce((v, f) => f(v), x);

const transform = pipe(
  str  => str.trim(),
  str  => str.toLowerCase(),
  str  => str.replace(/\s+/g, '-'),
  str  => `slug: ${str}`
);

transform("  Hello Beautiful World  ");
// → "slug: hello-beautiful-world"
```

