## 🌊 2. Async Iterator — Infinite Fibonacci Stream

```js
async function* fibonacci() {
  let [a, b] = [0, 1];
  while (true) {
    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 300)); // breathe ✨
    yield a;
    [a, b] = [b, a + b];
  }
}

for await (const n of fibonacci()) {
  if (n > 1000) break;
  console.log(n); // 0, 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8 ... 987
}
```

