## ⏳ 5. Debounce — The Elegant Way

```js
const debounce = (fn, ms) => {
  let timer;
  return (...args) => {
    clearTimeout(timer);
    timer = setTimeout(() => fn(...args), ms);
  };
};

const onSearch = debounce(query => {
  console.log(`Searching: "${query}"`);
}, 400);

// Rapid keystrokes — only the last one fires
['h','he','hel','hell','hello'].forEach(onSearch);
// → Searching: "hello" (after 400ms)
```

